From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:39:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(capsule): bound advisory identify and keep preflight off
 loop [daveey]

Address independent PR3953 review: command preflight runs off-loop; identify waits at most 0.5s for one context-bound verifier without caching late positives. Strict owner and child permissions remain uncached. Same-revision legacy path applies to submitter admission only.

Behavioral RED: both launch shapes fail event-loop preflight assertion and real socket identify loses default-timeout answer. GREEN: 203 tests across 14 consumers; scripts/check all21 OK.
